 "human_notes": {
  "_source": "jar (loot tables, spawn eggs, kill advancements) + 1 transcribed guide, which turned out to be about TAMING rather than fighting.",
  "measured_emphasis": [
   "The one guide that fit the time budget was 'All Tameable Mobs In Alex's Mobs', and its top mentions are entity:alexsmobs:raccoon, entity:alexsmobs:bald_eagle, entity:alexsmobs:crocodile, entity:alexsmobs:elephant, entity:alexsmobs:grizzly_bear, entity:alexsmobs:lobster",
   "That is the real lesson for this mod: the community frames Alex's Mobs as a taming/collection mod, so quests should lean on befriending and breeding rather than kill counts",
   "Thin evidence — one short video. The ordering below is structural, not something a teacher said"
  ],
  "boss_order": [
   "entity:alexsmobs:void_worm — the mod's one true boss, End-tier, drops alexsmobs:void_worm_eye and alexsmobs:void_worm_mandible",
   "entity:alexsmobs:warped_mosco — nether mini-boss (alexsmobs:hemolymph_sac, alexsmobs:warped_muscle)",
   "entity:alexsmobs:cachalot_whale and entity:alexsmobs:laviathan — large set-piece mobs rather than gated bosses"
  ],
  "prep": [
   "Alex's Mobs is a breadth mod, not a boss ladder: most content is one mob -> one drop -> one craftable, so quests should fan out rather than chain",
   "entity:alexsmobs:void_worm lives in the End and is the only fight that assumes endgame gear"
  ],
  "order": [
   "Overworld animals first (alexsmobs:bear_fur, alexsmobs:crocodile_scute, alexsmobs:moose_antler) — all obtainable pre-nether",
   "Nether tier: entity:alexsmobs:crimson_mosquito, entity:alexsmobs:warped_mosco, entity:alexsmobs:bone_serpent, entity:alexsmobs:straddler",
   "End tier: entity:alexsmobs:enderiophage, entity:alexsmobs:farseer, entity:alexsmobs:void_worm"
  ],
  "key_drops": [
   "alexsmobs:void_worm_eye, alexsmobs:void_worm_mandible — Void Worm",
   "alexsmobs:skreecher_soul — entity:alexsmobs:skreecher; alexsmobs:farseer_arm — entity:alexsmobs:farseer",
   "alexsmobs:mimicream — entity:alexsmobs:mimicube, a widely used crafting ingredient",
   "alexsmobs:dropbear_claw, alexsmobs:guster_eye, alexsmobs:rocky_shell, alexsmobs:capsid, alexsmobs:straddlite",
   "alexsmobs:mosquito_proboscis — entity:alexsmobs:crimson_mosquito"
  ],
  "traps": [
   "alexsmobs:centipede_body and alexsmobs:centipede_tail have loot tables but are SEGMENTS. The killable Cave Centipede is entity:alexsmobs:centipede_head — the one case where the '_head' id is the real mob",
   "alexsmobs:murmur_head duplicates the display name of entity:alexsmobs:murmur but is the detachable head, with no spawn egg and no loot table. Target alexsmobs:murmur",
   "alexsmobs:anaconda_part, :cachalot_part, :giant_squid_part, :void_worm_part are hitbox multiparts",
   "alexsmobs:void_worm_shot, :enderiophage_rocket, :mosquito_spit, :sand_shot, :squid_grapple are projectiles"
  ],
  "signature": [
   "entity:alexsmobs:void_worm",
   "entity:alexsmobs:mimicube",
   "entity:alexsmobs:crimson_mosquito",
   "entity:alexsmobs:cachalot_whale",
   "alexsmobs:mimicream",
   "alexsmobs:animal_dictionary"
  ]
 },
